<section class="content-panel content"><p>If you're a student applying or accepted to Edgerton, the <a href="/assets/uploads/2013/09/Orientation_Guide_2024-1.pdf">2024 Edgerton Orientation Guide</a> can help you plan your move and first couple of weeks in Cambridge, along with MIT's <a href="https://oge.mit.edu/grad-orientation/">Graduate Student Orientation</a> page. For the most current information on house policy, please see the <a href="/living-here/policies/">Policy</a> page. The <a href="https://studentlife.mit.edu/graduatestudentresources">MIT Resources</a> web site is also useful for new students.</p></section>
